    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/7f317f7c299b414017dfbf51f2dc8ab2.poster.avif?t=1735435848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/7f317f7c299b414017dfbf51f2dc8ab2.webm?t=1735435848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/7f317f7c299b414017dfbf51f2dc8ab2.mp4?t=1735435848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In bizarre lands, play as a viscous glob of water as you follow a trail of droplets and discover your fate...<br><br>Test your reflexes and use your unique abilities to evade enemies and find your path in this surreal platformer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traverse your way through 25 hand-crafted levels<br></li><li>Unique player mechanics<br></li><li>Battle 5 menacing bosses across 4 distinct worlds<br></li><li>Original artwork &amp; animation<br></li><li>Full controller support<br></li><li>Localization support</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/a2a7e32d1831afa1b46eca47d05760b9.poster.avif?t=1735435848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/a2a7e32d1831afa1b46eca47d05760b9.webm?t=1735435848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355720/extras/a2a7e32d1831afa1b46eca47d05760b9.mp4?t=1735435848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
